description:
Designed a routing layer that distributes payment attempts across multiple PSPs based on success rate, latency, and cost. Fallback logic automatically reroutes on failure within the same transaction attempt.

```javascript
async function routePayment(payload) {
  const psp = await selectOptimalPSP(payload.currency, payload.amount);
  try {
    return await psp.charge(payload);
  } catch (err) {
    return await fallbackPSP(payload, psp.id);
  }
}
```
